academic_email_domains.csv combines two public data sets.

1. Research Organization Registry (ROR), data dump v2.15 of 2026-10-20.
   ROR data is released under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal public
   domain dedication. No permission is needed to use it and no attribution is
   required; it is credited here because the source deserves it.
   https://ror.org

2. Hipo university-domains-list.
   https://github.com/Hipo/university-domains-list

